{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o061a","title":"大风吕范军溺死数千余军还江南","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o061a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"大风吕范军溺死数千余军还江南","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o061a-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e10","label":"正文","text":"夜大风王凌逆击漂岸吴军","evidence":["wgc-q0151","wgc-q0002"]},{"id":"hequan-a-d4a46ccad34bf47f50ca","label":"正文","text":"洞口诸军遭风流溺，所亡中分；赖齐军未济偏军独全（与《吴主传》溺死数千异说并陈）","evidence":["hequan-q-44b3fb56acdd9648a314"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-c0370e938c6f02c8d686","label":"正文","text":"时遭大风，船人覆溺，死者数千，还军","evidence":["zhulv-q-6442a0ec86ef4379b9ac"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0157","role":"损军还军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o061a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"率诸将逆击、捕斩首虏、获舟船","evidence":["wgc-q0151","wgc-q0002"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":222,"label":"冬十一月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o054","basis":"冬十一月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o061a-q","wuzhu-q-o054","guanzhang-q-o034","guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o061a-q","source_order":[47,301,"O061a"],"order":8224}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0004","name":"王凌","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0157","name":"吕范","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-be58a15ce144f67b67a5","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。马超的祠墓遗址，相传在今四川成都市新都区城南的马超小学内，曾有墓碑出土。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1fcace810489e51a4218","start":0,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o034","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7ddd1fa08ce5c9feb1d4","layer":"original","quote":"二年卒〖13〗，时年四十七。临没上疏曰：“臣门宗二百余口〖14〗，为孟德所诛略尽〖15〗；惟有从弟岱，当为微宗血食之继〖16〗，深托陛下。余无复言。”","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":143,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-44b3fb56acdd9648a314","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-5ed63010bb087005cebc","layer":"original","quote":"会洞口诸军遭风流溺〖2〗，所亡中分，将士失色；赖齐未济〖3〗，偏军独全，诸将倚以为势","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0002","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4be6add429aa347c7747","layer":"original","quote":"太祖辟为丞相掾、属。文帝践阼，拜散骑常侍。出为兖州刺史，与张辽等至广陵讨孙权。临江，夜大风，吴将吕范等船漂至北岸〖4〗。凌与诸将逆击，捕斩首虏，获舟船；有功，封宜城亭侯，加建武将军〖5〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0151","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-4be6add429aa347c7747","layer":"original","quote":"临江，夜大风，吴将吕范等船漂至北岸〖4〗。凌与诸将逆击，捕斩首虏，获舟船","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o061a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ce0679352de1ebc43456","layer":"original","quote":"冬十一月，大风，范等兵溺死者数千，余军还江南。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-6442a0ec86ef4379b9ac","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-fa9f8655bfd56be37fd7","layer":"original","quote":"时遭大风，船人覆溺，死者数千，还军","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":48,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
